# Dataset folders
# data/ 存放本地数据集和样本数据(MNIST/FashionMNIST/CIFAR-100/coco8 等),默认整体忽略,
# 不跟踪任何数据本体. 目录说明见 docs/md/architecture/local-data-directory.md.
data/
datasets/
raw_data/
rawdata/
processed_data/
images/
videos/
annotations/

